{"id":"n70900-2-8","stage":1,"title":"유행 · 流行","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70900-2-8-1","ko":"나 잠깐 나갔다 올게.","zh":"我出去一会儿就回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"잠깐","meaning":"一下，暂时地","explanation":"잠깐：一下，暂时地。","readings":[{"term":"잠깐","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57313","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠깐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠깐","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3"}},{"text":"나갔다","meaning":"出去（再回来）","explanation":"나갔다 올게 整体表示“出去一下就回来”；前半说出去，后半说回来。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나갔다","audio":"/audio/4474ae87d501bfa3b579.mp3"}},{"text":"올게.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올게","audio":"/audio/d954da940fe58eaea456.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"4e073566099677ea","term":"잠깐","zh":"一下，暂时地","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3","entryId":"57313","definition":"在非常短暂的时间内。","pronunciation":["잠깐"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"出去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"从室内或所在处出去；与 올게 连用表示出去后回来。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/21e0b18c97cc6cb45979.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70900-2-8-2","ko":"감기가 유행이니까 따뜻하게 입고 나가.","zh":"现在感冒很流行，出门记得穿暖和点。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"감기가","meaning":"感冒","explanation":"감기：感冒；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"감기","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28635","senseId":"1","lemma":"감기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감기가","audio":"/audio/d900d01cd84038266b50.mp3"}},{"text":"유행이니까","meaning":"流行","explanation":"유행：流行；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"유행","audio":"/audio/4e036fa50e83b243700b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70900","senseId":"2","lemma":"유행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유행이니까","audio":"/audio/3608e35b490490612e21.mp3"}},{"text":"따뜻하게","meaning":"穿得暖和些","explanation":"따뜻하게 修饰 입다，表示把衣服穿暖和，而不是说衣服自己变暖。","readings":[{"term":"따뜻하다","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57297","senseId":"1","lemma":"따뜻하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따뜻하게","audio":"/audio/c0681214abc6da5f51e0.mp3"}},{"text":"입고","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입고","audio":"/audio/abf4f911317e9d7bed28.mp3"}},{"text":"나가.","meaning":"出门","explanation":"나가 在这里是从屋里出去；前面说感冒流行，提醒出门时穿暖和些。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나가","audio":"/audio/2ea9b6f2f116b0039a33.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2c4cdf56b777f367","term":"감기","zh":"感冒","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3","entryId":"28635","definition":"一般伴有咳嗽、流鼻涕、头痛、发冷等症状的传染病。","pronunciation":["감ː기"]},{"id":"4e036fa50e83b243","term":"유행","zh":"流行","audio":"/audio/4e036fa50e83b243700b.mp3","entryId":"70900","definition":"传染病广泛传播。","pronunciation":["유행"]},{"id":"e4840ad0903352f1","term":"따뜻하다","zh":"暖和","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3","entryId":"57297","definition":"温度适中，不觉得太热，达到心情舒适的程度。","pronunciation":["따뜨타다"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"出去、出门","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"从所在处走到外面；本句指要出门。","pronunciation":["나가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b84415211f03ad673108.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.98,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70900","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":32,"sequenceScore":1.3805,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我出去一会儿就回来。","现在感冒很流行，出门记得穿暖和点。","这里有卖相机吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我出去一会儿就回来。","现在感冒很流行，出门记得穿暖和点。","这里有卖相机吗？"],"answer":1}]}
